      "status": "worked",
      "method": "There are 6×4=24 equally likely ordered dice outcomes.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "explanation": "<p>Only(5,3)has product 15.</p><span class=\"equation\" data-display=\"true\" data-math=\"P=1/24\"></span>"
        },
        {
