        },
        {
          "explanation": "<p>For four-sided scores 1,2,3,4, the numbers of six-sided scores giving a product above 10 are 0,1,3,4.</p><span class=\"equation\" data-display=\"true\" data-math=\"P=(0+1+3+4)/24=1/3\"></span>"
        }
      ],
      "solutionHtml": "<p>There are 6×4=24 equally likely ordered dice outcomes.</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li><p>Only(5,3)has product 15.</p><span class=\"equation\" data-display=\"true\" data-math=\"P=1/24\"></span></li><li><p>A product is odd only if both scores are odd.</p><span class=\"equation\" data-display=\"true\" data-math=\"P(\\text{even})=1-(3/6)(2/4)=3/4\"></span></li><li><p>For four-sided scores 1,2,3,4, the numbers of six-sided scores giving a product above 10 are 0,1,3,4.</p><span class=\"equation\" data-display=\"true\" data-math=\"P=(0+1+3+4)/24=1/3\"></span></li></ol>",
      "answerCheck": "matches"
    },
